\newlabel{tab:robustness_k}{{7}{6}{Robustness to misspecified $K$ (synthetic extreme, $n_{\text {expert}}=500$). $^\dagger $Bias reduction vs.\ naive. Underspecifying $K$ (2 for 4) or discretizing a continuous axis reduces EC-HTE benefit but still outperforms global on bias}{table.caption.18}{}}
